  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14234808/assets/2f95783c1e9624e58b4cd26764e94fb61d45c7aa75260ce8ca726a6c2e5db9ab.png)\n\nThe triple integral of $f(x,y,z)$ over the region $R$ (shown above) can be expressed as the following repeated integral:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{3-3z/2}^{3}{\\int }_{8-4x/3-2z}^{4}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\n$$\n\nRewrite this repeated integral by integrating first with respect to $y,$ then $z,$ and then $x.$",
